; `× $slot` and a literal `*` are one unsigned 8.8 multiply (language.md §8,
; opcodes.md PARAM_MUL / PARAM_MUL_VAL): a slot of 256 is ×1, 128 is ×½, and
; the product drops its fraction — in the driver and the preview alike.
(def-val level 128 0..256)
(def-val bright 384 0..512)
(fm1 :tempo 120 :alg 4 :ar2 31 :ar4 31 :tl2 40 :tl4 8 :len 4
  :vol 28 :vol* $level c
  :tl2* $bright e
  :tl2* 0.5 g a)
